      "text": "Put the {batter.flour} and half of the {salt} in a bowl and make a well in the middle. Break in the {batter.egg:plural} and whisk, drawing in the {batter.flour} little by little, then whisk in the {batter.milk} until the batter is smooth and pours like thin cream. Leave it to stand while the oven heats.",
