      "works_on": ["preparation/pudding-batter"],
      "with": ["ingredient/pork-sausage", "ingredient/oil"],
      "text": "Put the rest of the {oil} in a roasting tin and heat it in a very hot oven until it smokes. Working quickly, set the {sausages:plural} in the tin and pour the batter around them; it should sizzle. Bake without opening the door until the batter is puffed, crisp and deep golden. Check the {sausages:plural} against a trusted guide to doneness.",
